# Drop your trained model weights here.
# Supported formats: .onnx (recommended), .pt / .pth (PyTorch), .h5 (Keras)
#
# Expected filename (set MODEL_PATH in .env to match):
#   crop_disease_model.onnx   ← ONNX Runtime (cross-platform, fastest)
#   best_model.pt             ← PyTorch checkpoint
#   plant_disease_model.h5    ← Keras/TensorFlow SavedModel
#
# This directory is gitignored for binary blobs — only .gitkeep is tracked.
